(text "4. ULTRASONIC SENSOR" (at 317.5 162.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "575d414f-4bec-4b72-8bd8-306de05600f0"))
(text "R1: ECHO to GPIO2; R2: GPIO2 to GND. 5V echo -> 3.0V.\nNever connect raw ECHO directly to ESP. Use 1% resistors.\nC2 near sensor. GPIO1/2 distance-reading firmware still required." (at 157.48 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "56779c81-6323-49f1-8aad-d41795de33ff"))
(text "CECE - BATTERY POWER + USB PROGRAMMING" (at 20.32 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8273f1f8-24f5-4927-b3e8-07ed153c285e"))
(text "Normal run: battery powers ESP + four SG90s | USB for programming only | Camera / mic / Wi-Fi retained" (at 20.32 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e5afc53a-801e-471d-96f6-4ed7a89da39d"))
(text "1. BATTERY / SWITCH / REGULATOR" (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "069aa3d3-4f8e-4c1b-b235-18fdc181d6cb"))
(text "2. CONTROLLER / SERVO SOCKETS" (at 241.3 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b913f0d4-1f30-4a78-96ef-85f40f032004"))
(text "Leave these three\ncontrol pins unwired." (at 76.2 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "46671b21-0594-4cbc-9fe6-1db79c0f473f"))
(text "Set and measure\n5.0V BEFORE connecting." (at 157.48 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b00ff767-036b-4ee9-8e55-df928d6e62e3"))
(text "C1 + to 5V; striped\nnegative side to GND." (at 195.58 99.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5e7fd57e-f81e-470f-82c6-824833171566"))
(text "3. ESP POWER + SIGNAL CONNECTIONS" (at 20.32 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a8c0eb9a-1461-41e2-b70f-b4c6bc31fd02"))
(text "Camera / mic on Sense add-on.\nUSB VBUS and 5V header are\ninternally common (ESP_5V)." (at 86.36 185.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cf36ee69-761e-42c0-b188-e5304d71a167"))
(text "JP1: fitted to RUN; REMOVE before USB.\nD1 banded end -> ESP 5V header." (at 15.24 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a7066346-fd49-48a0-aa05-2cff82836325"))
(text "Both address switches OFF\nI2C address 0x44\nSockets 1/2 = hips; 3/4 = feet\nChip channels = 3/2/1/0" (at 246.38 162.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e7d7685e-3a85-4a5f-b4dd-cfb432ff5ef2"))
(text "5. OLED - 1.5 inch / 128 x 128" (at 20.32 220.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "61e164e1-a206-413e-83b7-3f340b0f3a65"))
(text "4-wire STEMMA QT cable to spare PiicoDev I2C socket.\nSame net labels = electrically joined. VIN uses 3V3, NOT 5V.\nDATA -> D4/GPIO5; CLK -> D5/GPIO6. No extra GPIO.\nJ1 + J2 closed (I2C); A0 open = 0x3D (driver = 0x44).\nOther OLED header pins unused. See OLED_WIRING.txt." (at 20.32 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "be9a2539-91f0-4c2f-b32c-65184bfd5867"))
(text "RUN: USB unplugged, JP1 fitted. PROGRAM: switch OFF,\nREMOVE JP1 before USB. D1 alone does not stop backfeed.\nNever connect 2S pack to ESP BAT+ or 5V header.\nCharging: unplug main battery lead from robot; use a 2S\nLiPo balance charger. Exact charger pinout still unverified.\nSee POWER_AND_CHARGING.txt for both battery plugs." (at 157.48 261.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "578bad9e-5372-4d67-bff7-bb0dc9d515a2"))
(text "MODULE DRAWING\nFollow printed terminal labels, not block positions.\nModule wiring only; no physical footprint mapping.\nSwitch is ON/OFF, not safety isolation." (at 294.64 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e5ae35a9-d82e-4395-86da-ea6870baeb99"))
